th linked_artifact_note_conflict (exit 4, nothing written, no history entry); details.conflicts lists path, scope, existing_note and requested_note, and next steps replay the whole invocation with --note-conflict append or replace, carrying its revision guards. New closed-domain flag --note-conflict refuse|replace|append (default refuse; SDK and MCP noteConflict): replace keeps the earlier overwrite, append joins with '; ' and is idempotent. mutation_receipt.link_outcomes reports added, note_added, note_replaced, note_appended or unchanged per requested link; identical and note-less repeats stay no-ops. reviseLinkedNote and LINKED_ARTIFACT_NOTE_CONFLICT_MODES are exported; strict MCP schema 4.25.0; flag lexicon +1 for files and docs."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"pm files and pm docs --add no longer overwrite another agent's note: a different stored note is refused by default, --note-conflict replace or append resolves it explicitly, and every write reports each link's outcome"}],"before_hash":"a3ad889ee91a57b92644be1fcf390aa495fe7b6f2f589421940588fc2cda9009","after_hash":"73fbf71ab82b3e7eed72102385beb1630ec618ff0d32c798d1a1f8c65c2bc2c1","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-13T16:34:00.994Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7f8bd9dbcf8cf0ea21aea2703432c0757d2f2e29e4edfe82cefbedfa36642f58"}
